---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" locale="en">
  <section class="privacy section">
    <h1 class="index-h1">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <p>
        KiKi Gallery (“the Gallery”) respects the privacy of users of this
        website and handles the information it collects appropriately.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">1. Information We May Collect</h2>

      <p>
        This website may collect the following information as necessary for
        responding to inquiries and improving our services:
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>Name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Details of inquiries</li>
        <li>Usage information collected through website analytics</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">2. How We Use Information</h2>

      <p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>

      <ul>
        <li>Responding to inquiries</li>
        <li>Providing information about exhibitions and services</li>
        <li>Improving the website and analyzing its usage</li>
        <li>Preventing unauthorized use</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">3. Cookies</h2>

      <p>
        This website may use cookies to improve usability and for website
        analytics. Cookies can be disabled through your browser settings.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">4. Website Analytics</h2>

      <p>
        This website may use analytics tools to understand how the website is
        accessed and used.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">5. Links to External Services</h2>

      <p>
        This website contains links to external services such as Instagram.
        Please refer to the privacy policies of the respective service providers
        regarding the handling of personal information on those external sites.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">6. Management of Personal Information</h2>

      <p>
        We manage the information we collect appropriately and will not provide
        it to third parties without the individual's consent, except where
        required by law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>

      <p>
        This policy may be changed without prior notice when necessary. Any
        changes will take effect when the revised policy is posted on this
        website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="privacy-section">
      <h2 class="privacy-heading">Contact</h2>

      <p>
        For inquiries regarding this policy, please contact us at the address
        below.
      </p>

      <p>
        KiKi Gallery<br />
        Email: info@example.com
      </p>

      <p>Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</Layout>
